{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786122221258571002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cold-unfleshly-fanworms","assignee":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"5333807695bb7d4bbe1e4cba73dbee9cdba83f229b9fb4820d72d020acc76270","event_uuid":"b6048673-177e-4aa4-8b66-bb9ebe6fd9e2","position":{"commit_sha":"b7423ecf79b6ab0c4e1cff1f19e3e55814f46227","position":"1786100814284841001-b6048673-177e-4aa4-8b66-bb9ebe6fd9e2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b64a7113306696077045e94e8d8d8d2d753b1eef61fb6c8708bcfeb70d0b71ad","event_uuid":"9c1227f9-3653-42ea-9100-6c2f73c7bda5","position":{"commit_sha":"1d595e86ac855d8c8b43a4ef92343a6176fd179e","position":"1786100831790967001-9c1227f9-3653-42ea-9100-6c2f73c7bda5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"75ba280e2d6dc7a8dad55ad4c782f611e67f4c868b96c47b003233060654a489","event_uuid":"c60329cb-af2b-4e72-b2a8-46c94b9af817","position":{"commit_sha":"f47581689bcb395d390a32fb615cf03a2988703d","position":"1786122219862393001-c60329cb-af2b-4e72-b2a8-46c94b9af817"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"33cea32741194ab8878e5f7842d46bfd37f7245e74996b2cf37ee10768eefdaa","event_uuid":"b5bf7734-38c4-42ea-bed3-582eb9debf80","position":{"commit_sha":"f47581689bcb395d390a32fb615cf03a2988703d","position":"1786122221258571001-b5bf7734-38c4-42ea-bed3-582eb9debf80"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786100814284841001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9c1227f9-3653-42ea-9100-6c2f73c7bda5","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e7a9-35fa-1d58-4095"}],"description":"The write-time secret screen (bug e7a9) is enforced at `_seam.finalize_event`, the one\nseam every writer routes through. Two callers of that seam handle a refusal in a way that\ndeserves its own review; neither blocks e7a9, and both were found by an adversarial review\nof the e7a9 change rather than by a failure.\n\n## 1. Sidecar emits swallow the refusal\n\n`llm/plan_review/sidecar.py`, `llm/completion_sidecar.py`, and `llm/code_review/sidecar.py`\nall wrap their `append_event` in `except Exception: logger.warning(...); return False`.\nREVIEW_RESULT / COMPLETION_VERDICT payloads embed the reviewed MATERIAL (diffs, plan text),\nso a test fixture or a documented detection regex inside that material can make the verdict\nevent unwritable — and it is then dropped with only a warning, with no override path (no CLI\nflag reaches those code paths). The result is silent loss of the gate's own audit trail.\n\nOptions to weigh: exempt the sidecar event types from the screen (accepts that reviewed\nmaterial can carry a secret into the store); distinguish the screen refusal from a generic\nemit failure and surface it loudly; or screen only the sidecar's own prose fields rather\nthan the embedded material.\n\nMeasured context: sweeping the live store's 25,125 events with the shipped patterns, exactly\none would be refused, and it is a false positive (`AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE`, AWS's own published\ndoc example, quoted in a ticket ABOUT secret scanning). So the real-world rate is low — but\nthe sidecar path is exactly where \"prose about credentials\" concentrates.\n\n## 2. Inbound Jira translate now fails the event loudly\n\n`_engine/rebar_reconciler/inbound_translate._write_event_file` previously called the two\nhalves of `finalize_event` directly, which made it a genuine bypass: a credential pasted\ninto a Jira comment would have landed in the store and reproduced the original\npush-protection wedge. e7a9 routes it through `finalize_event`, so it is screened now.\n\nThe consequence is that one credential-bearing Jira comment raises during translate. That is\nthe correct refusal, but it means untrusted external input can fail an inbound reconcile.\nWorth deciding whether that event should instead be SKIPPED with a loud warning so the rest\nof the sync proceeds — refusal either way, different blast radius.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"c60329cb-af2b-4e72-b2a8-46c94b9af817","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"4802-b3ab-2659-4d8f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Secret-screen refusals are swallowed by LLM sidecars; inbound reconcile fails loudly","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b6048673-177e-4aa4-8b66-bb9ebe6fd9e2","9c1227f9-3653-42ea-9100-6c2f73c7bda5","c60329cb-af2b-4e72-b2a8-46c94b9af817","b5bf7734-38c4-42ea-bed3-582eb9debf80"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786122221258571002,"uuid":"72081ba3-1560-40dd-8fee-ef9d809d43f7"}